T:Boatman's Song
L:1/8
M:C|
C:Trad arr. © 2019 Ben Paley
N:Note the extra beat in the repeat of the B part — i.e. you leave an extra beat before coming
N:back to the A part. And don't forget the pick-up quarter-note E when coming back!
